Subject: [PATCH 6/6] test(thread): pin the R-plane door on an unstated pitch
 and judge's dive-only filter

The two non-blocking gaps of the #1301 review: the operation door's
"pitch not stated yet" branch asks thread_r_plane::door (a new Thread
on a single-form mill with a low fixed R plane is refused when made),
and judge reads only vertical rapids down - a sideways rapid (even a
descending one) or a rapid going up that ends under the stock left
ahead is not the dive. Each mutation (the door call dropped, the
filter's sideways or upward half or the whole filter removed) fails a
pin.

